# Loaded only by `npm run dev:harness` (vite --mode harness).
#
# Turns on the dev persona/breakpoint/"All screens" rail in src/dev/DevHarness.tsx.
# Plain `npm run dev` deliberately leaves it off so the dev server shows the
# same app a real visitor gets — the rail is a review tool, not part of the
# product, and it used to make every screen render inside a fixed 390px frame.
#
# A mode file rather than an inline env var in the npm script, so it works the
# same in PowerShell, cmd, and a POSIX shell. Safe to commit: no secrets, and
# it never applies to `npm run build`.
VITE_DEV_HARNESS=1
